Type of technology that allows machines and software to do tasks that usually require human intelligence — like understanding language, recognizing patterns, or making decisions.

How it is Used

The County uses AI in various endeavors, including identifying racial covenants in historical housing documents. AI helps scan and analyze large volumes of records quickly, spotting key terms and patterns that would take humans much longer to review.";}s:8:"relation";a:2:{s:10:"references";a:4:{s:18:"glossary:algorithm";b:1;s:22:"glossary:generative_ai";b:1;s:12:"glossary:agi";b:1;s:12:"glossary:llm";b:1;}s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}s:8:"internal";a:2:{s:5:"cache";b:1;s:3:"toc";b:1;}}s:10:"persistent";a:5:{s:4:"date";a:2:{s:7:"created";i:1744829226;s:8:"modified";i:1744833646;}s:7:"creator";s:11:"Aditya Seth";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:11:"last_change";a:9:{s:4:"date";i:1744833646;s:2:"ip";s:14:"73.235.164.232";s:4:"type";s:1:"E";s:2:"id";s:11:"glossary:ai";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:3:"sum";s:0:"";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:70;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}s:11:"contributor";a:1:{s:5:"admin";s:11:"Aditya Seth";}}}